               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Implement ContainerUpdateIteratorSafety::eUpdateInvalidatesIterators safe iterator usage checks",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "This means probably having a container CHANGE count and on every iteration,",
                     "type" : "text"
